### status: none
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: true
### destructive: false
### requiresTenantHeaders: true
### llmOperational: false
### protectedContract: true
### referenceOnly: false
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### responseShapeHint: capabilities-snapshot
### selectionGuidance: protected-contract-governed-audio-readiness
### note: Corporate identity must be resolved server-side from the authenticated session; headers are scope hints, not identity or permission.
### note: Returns only { "available": boolean } with Cache-Control: no-store. Availability means local provider support and effective credential configuration; it does not prove connectivity, key validity or quota and makes no provider call.
### note: Query before microphone permission. Only available=true permits capture; false, missing, failed or unauthorized discovery must not trigger browser-speech or direct-provider fallback.
### note: This contract example has no published-runtime confirmation. Quickstart enterprise admission requires the current context stamp and may reject session/scope/version/source before readiness (401/403/409/503). Provider/configuration readiness failures return available=false without sensitive details.

@baseUrl = https://praxis-api-quickstart.onrender.com
@tenantId = demo
@userId = example-user
@envId = public
@allowedOrigin = http://localhost:4301
@sessionCookie = replace-with-authenticated-session-cookie
@contextVersion = replace-with-current-runtime-effective-context-version

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/praxis/config/ai/transcriptions/capabilities
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{allowedOrigin}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
X-Env: {{envId}}
X-Praxis-Context-Version: {{contextVersion}}
Cookie: SESSION={{sessionCookie}}
